    <title>[October 12 – 16, 2026] Galaxy Beyond Basics: Mastering Workflows, Automation, and Scalability</title>
    <link href="https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/events/2026-10-12-Advanced-Galaxy-Training.html"/>
